  "subTitleDesc": null,
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "資電概論與倫理",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION AND ETHICS TO INFORMATION AND ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": "分成兩部分，一為「資電概論」，針對本院規劃的十二個學程作概略式的介紹，課程分別為電腦系統、軟體工程、網際網路工程、電磁與能源工程、光電工程、電波工程、半導體與電子元件、IC設計、光機電工程、生醫工程、無線通訊、數位通訊，讓同學對於資訊電機領域的基本知識與產業概況有基本認識。另一為「倫理」，包含倫理的觀念、工程倫理的規範以及各系專業倫理的案例，希望藉由倫理課程的講授與訓練，培養學生於工程倫理的素養。",
    "describe_eh": "This curriculum mainly divides into two parts, one is “Introduction to Information and Electrical Engineering”. It is an introduction course designed for freshmen. According to the 12 programs provided in this college, this part course is divided into 12 subtopics. Each program has an introduction to its subject area. The 12 programs are computer system program, software engineering program,  internet engineering program, electromagnetic and energy resource program, electrooptics engineering program, electromagnetic wave engineering program, semiconductor program, electronic device program, VLSI design program, microelectromechanics system engineering program, wireless communication program, wideband network program and processing program. \nThe other part of this course is “Ethics”. The contents include the concept of ethics, the criteria of engineering ethics, and the ethics case studies for various programs in the college.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "了解資訊電機控制與物聯網之基本理論與應用。",
      "describe_en": "To have a fundamental knowledge of information and electrical engineering and the Internet of Things application."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "認識物聯網與光機電科技之應用現況及其在相關產業之發展，提昇學生之國際觀。",
      "describe_en": "To know the applications of the Internet of Things and Opto-mechatronics technologies and their development in related industries."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "培養學生暸解工程上之相關專業倫理以及案例討論",
      "describe_en": "Comprehension of the value of engineering ethics and case studies for various ethics programs in the college."
    }
  ],
